6182..6258 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6259..6333 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6334..6410 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6411..6485 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6486..6494 Comment "/// `g`."
